{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000071537","approvedSymbol":"SEL1L","functionDescriptions":["Plays a role in the endoplasmic reticulum quality control (ERQC) system also called ER-associated degradation (ERAD) involved in ubiquitin-dependent degradation of misfolded endoplasmic reticulum proteins (PubMed:16186509, PubMed:29997207, PubMed:37943610, PubMed:37943617). Enhances SYVN1 stability. Plays a role in LPL maturation and secretion. Required for normal differentiation of the pancreas epithelium, and for normal exocrine function and survival of pancreatic cells. May play a role in Notch signaling. {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:Q9Z2G6, ECO:0000269|PubMed:16186509, ECO:0000269|PubMed:29997207, ECO:0000269|PubMed:37943610, ECO:0000269|PubMed:37943617}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"Q9UBV2","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"G3V3B3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"ENSP00000337053","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000450709","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000451144","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000540964","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000540965","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000540966","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000540967","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000540968","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000623187","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000623188","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000623189","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000623190","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000623191","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000623192","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000623193","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000623194","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000677718","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000677719","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000677720","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000677721","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000677722","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000681107","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000681108","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000681109","source":"ensem